cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Isoclock in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Isoclock"
abstract: >-
  Offline software for the reduction of LA-ICP-MS U-Th-Pb data of minerals
  carrying variable common Pb. Isoclock performs data import, background
  correction and outlier filtering, common-Pb correction on the reference
  material, downhole fractionation calibration and Sample-Standard-Bracketing
  age calculation. It reads raw files from Thermo, Agilent and Element
  instruments and runs either from the command line or through a GUI.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Liu"
    given-names: "Guoqi"
    email: "sndjgm@foxmail.com"
    affiliation: "East China University of Technology"
version: "2.0"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/sndjgm/Isoclock"
keywords:
  - "LA-ICP-MS"
  - "U-Pb geochronology"
  - "U-Th-Pb dating"
  - "common Pb correction"
  - "accessory minerals"
  - "hydrothermal minerals"
  - "data reduction"
